### Requires BTH3 running on localhost:8081 with product ID 2 and quantity >= 2.
### If you deleted product ID 2, first POST a new product to BTH3 and replace the ID below.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082

### 1. Create order (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### 2. List orders (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders

### 3. Get order (replace 1 with returned ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/1

### 4. Update a PENDING order (replace ID and product ID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Nguyen Van B",
  "items": [ { "productId": 2, "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### 5. Confirm order (200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CONFIRMED" }

### 6. Complete order (200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "COMPLETED" }

### 7. To test delete, create a DIFFERENT PENDING order, then replace 2 with its ID (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/2

### 8. Validation: out of stock (422, if quantity exceeds product's available stock)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "items": [ { "productId": 2, "quantity": 999999 } ]
}
